WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:01.280
Tangkap mereka

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.400
(Episode 18)

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:04.240
Kalian mau apa?

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:07.000
Lepaskan aku! Lepaskan aku!

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:07.640
Jiko!

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:09.240
Kalau mau cari mati

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:10.440
jangan libatkan kami!

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:13.040
Dengar gak?

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.240
Jangan teriak 
jangan berontak 

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:16.960
Tujuannya sudah tercapai

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.200
Tujuan apa?

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.840
Nyamar jadi Grup Saga itu hukuman mati

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:22.080
Kita memang

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.080
kerabat mereka

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:24.480
Kalau

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.960
petinggi Grup Saga datang

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:28.240
gimana kita bisa lolos?

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:29.760
Sekarang kita bisa lolos

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:31.120
Tadi kamu juga menamparnya

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.280
kita sudah jadi 
musuh mereka

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:34.040
Aduh

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:35.720
Lagi pula aku sudah bantu Grup Saga

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:37.080
jaga martabatnya

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:38.200
sampai putus hubungan

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:39.320
Benar juga

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:41.360
Kalau begitu kita tunjukkan 

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:43.640
sebenci apa kita padanya 

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:45.920
Kalau petinggi 
Grup Saga datang

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:47.880
mungkin kita bisa 
dapat keuntungan 

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:48.560
Iya, iya

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:53.400
Nona Lili

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.040
nanti kamu

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:56.400
harus bantu kami bicara yang baik-baik

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:57.560
Iya, iya, iya 

00:00:57.640 --> 00:00:58.920
Kami gak tahu apa-apa

00:00:59.000 --> 00:00:59.560
Iya, iya, iya 

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:01.920
Aku tadinya 
paman Selia 

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:03.280
tapi hari ini

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:04.960
aku menyatakan 
putus hubungan

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:06.400
dengan Keluarga Dara

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:09.720
Tuan Domi

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:12.320
Aku tahu 
niat Linken baik

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:14.280
dia gak mau 
kerabat kami

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:15.720
meremehkan Selia

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:18.600
Tapi gak perlu nyamar jadi Grup Saga

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:19.560
Tuan Jiko

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:22.320
Kerabat dan teman memusuhimu 

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:23.640
Bagi keluarga kalian

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:25.280
itu bukan 
hal yang buruk

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:27.320
Ini bukan 
hal yang buruk? 

